  "solution": "Given equation : 30 * 95 * 5 * 32 * 4 * 497\n\nAccording to the question, by replacing the * signs:\n\n**Option - (1) : +, ×, –, =, ÷**\n\n30 + **__95 × 5__** – 32 = 4 ÷ 497\n\n30 + 475 – 32 = 0.008048\n\n473 ≠ 0.008048\n\n(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option - (2) : ×, +, –, ÷, =**\n\n30 × 95 + 5 –__** 32 ÷ 4**__ = 497\n\n2850 + 5 – 8 = 497\n\n2847 ≠ 497\n\n(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option - (3) : +, ×, ÷, –, = **\n\n30 + 95 × 5 ÷ 32 – 4 = 497\n\n30 + 475 ÷ 32 - 4 = 497\n\n30 + 14.84375 - 4 ≠ 497\n\n40.84375 ≠ 497\n\n(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option - (4) : +, ×, –, ÷, = **\n\n**30 + 95 × 5 – 32 ÷ 4 = 497 **\n\n**30 + 475 – 8 = 497 **\n\n**497 = 497 **\n\n**(LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Hence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.**",
